[en.FOCUS_C18_101_LI]
Li

[en.FOCUS_C18_101_LI_desc]
Li, strong on the outside while soft on the inside, beautiful and bright. Like a candle burning, illuminating everything but cold instead of hot, it is not the fire of destruction, but the fire of life.\nThe sun shines on all things, making them grow strong and healthy. The Kirins, just like their leader Autumn Blaze, are full of energy and enthusiasm. If this flame of passion is put into §Cindustry§! and production, the Kirin tribe will not lose to any other creature.\nLet the flame no longer burn our homes, but smelt steel for us, light up the long nights for us, cook delicious food for us, and dispel the cold for us. In the blizzard, the Kirins’ factories and towers will stand tall.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_101_LI]
离

[zh.FOCUS_C18_101_LI_desc]
离，外刚健而内柔顺，美丽明亮。如烛火燃烧，光照万物却冷而不热，非毁灭之火，生命之火也。\n日照丽万物茁壮而生，麒麟们，正如他们的领袖秋烨一般，浑身充满着能量与热情。将这种热情的火苗投入到§C工业§!与生产中，则麒麟族不输任何其他生物。\n让火焰不再焚烧我们的家园，而是为我们冶炼钢铁、照亮长夜、烹饪美食、驱散寒冷。在暴风雪中，麒麟族的工厂与高塔将屹立不倒。

